SUMMARY:Mystic Picnic! in-person\, Raleigh area\, last Saturdays
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nDo you enjoy spiri
 tual growth? Are you having amazing experiences that you can’t talk abou
 t with most people? Join the club!\n\nEvery last Saturday at the Mystic Pi
 cnic from March to October\, we create a safe fun outdoor space for meetin
 g kindred souls and clarifying the concepts that set us free in these asce
 nsion times when the realities are so clearly diverging. Which parallel Ea
 rth are you from\, and what are you here to do?\n\nWe share stories and su
 pport energy healing\, psychic gifts\, angels\, nature spirits\, ET helper
 s\, reincarnation\, lucid dreams\, and so much more. We keep it real\, gro
 unded\, positive\, and heart-centered\, so folks can bring their genuine c
 oncerns without the big conspiracies. I’ve experienced so many wonders m
 yself\, so I’ll be hosting a main circle for friendly discussions. There
  will be potluck food and a nice grassy field for activities.\n\nBring a c
 hair if you have\, plus food or drink you want to share. I’ll supply cup
 s\, plates\, napkins and utensils\, plus extra chairs and snacks. We meet 
 at Lake Crabtree park off Route 40 between Durham and Raleigh\, NC. Enter 
 park from Aviation Parkway\, proceed to first parking lot on right. If lot
  is full\, drive to the next lot and walk back\, or wait as people come an
 d go frequently. You’ll see me with some chairs near the lot (I’ll get
  the best spot available)\n\nRe-member. You matter. Time and space are rit
 uals. You decide your own future. Your imagination is the doorway. Your co
 nsciousness creates your own reality.\n\n"I was alive and I waited for thi
 s. Right here\, right now\, there is no other place I wanna be. Watching t
 he world wake up from history."\n\\-\\- Jesus Jones video: [https://www.yo
 utube.com/watch?v=GNJpLU8qcx8](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNJpLU8qcx8
 )\n\n"There's a starman waiting in the sky. He's told us not to blow it 'c
 ause he knows it's all worthwhile."\n\\-\\- astral David Bowie saves the w
 orld in January's stunning 10 year tribute video: [https://www.youtube.com
 /watch?v=ZcC0QWsfpAQ](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZcC0QWsfpAQ)\n\nMy n
 ame is Carl and I’m cross-posting this event in several meetups for maxi
 mum networking fun. To see our spiritual meetup events [www.meetup.com/inn
 er-selves-for-outer-mastery/](http://www.meetup.com/inner-selves-for-outer
 -mastery/) YouTube channel [https://www.youtube.com/@InnerSelvesMastery](h
 ttps://www.youtube.com/@InnerSelvesMastery) and newsletter [www.SignupISM.
 com](http://www.SignupISM.com) Everyone is welcome to also join and post t
 heir own spiritual community events at [https://www.meetup.com/starseedsof
 raleigh/](https://www.meetup.com/starseedsofraleigh/)\n\nbest wishes\,\nCa
 rl Johann Schroeder\nSpiritual Teaching and Life Coaching\n[www.InnerSelve
 sMastery.com](http://www.InnerSelvesMastery.com)\nquick links: [www.Signup
 ISM.com](http://www.SignupISM.com)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/raleigh-triangle-activities/events/31
 4970363/
